WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.130 --> 00:00:05.030
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to
do at the Foundation: Dr. Bright is not allowed

00:00:05.030 --> 00:00:07.720
to send e-mails with memetic hazards attached!

00:00:07.720 --> 00:00:10.240
No, not even when replying to spam!

00:00:10.240 --> 00:00:11.240
Dr. Bright.

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:15.520
We don't care how annoying it is when your
inbox fills up with suspicious links, Linda's

00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:19.439
annoying Quote of The Day, and chain letters
telling you that you have to forward the email

00:00:19.439 --> 00:00:22.210
to 10 people or have bad luck for a year.

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:25.669
That doesn't make it okay to reply with SCP-2774
attached!

00:00:25.669 --> 00:00:28.339
That goes for any other memetic hazard.

00:00:28.339 --> 00:00:33.680
The last thing we need is more instances of
these hazards floating around in cyberspace.

00:00:33.680 --> 00:00:37.950
Take a breath, stand up from the keyboard,
and let the spam filter do its job.

